# Mycosynth Lattice, then Humility. Layer 4: the Lattice makes every permanent an artifact, Humility (an Artifact
# Enchantment now, no creature) and Bot2's Llanowar Elves (an artifact creature) among them. Layer 5: everything is
# colorless. Layer 6: Humility takes the Elves' "{T}: Add {G}" (CR 613.1f), so on turn 6 Bot2 can't tap it for mana, though
# it could on turn 4, before Humility (the positive control; the Lattice let the Island's {U} cast it on turn 2). Layer 7b:
# the Elves are 1/1. The Lattice is no creature and keeps its abilities, so Humility's {2}{W}{W} is paid with Sol Ring's {C}{C}
# and the Moxes' {B}{R} (CR 609.4b).

